# Standalone / one-click deploy: app at `/`, canvas at `/canvas/`, catalog at `/sam/`.
# Leave empty for root mount (required for Cloudflare / Vercel / Netlify self-host).
# Blog-style mount would be `/playgrounds` (legacy only).
PUBLIC_PLAYGROUNDS_BASE_PATH=
